---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Privacy policy"
  description="How HotNow handles your account, your leads, and the data used to find companies and contacts."
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap privacy">
      <h1>Privacy policy</h1>
      <p class="updated">Last updated: October 29, 2026</p>

      <p>
        HotNow sends you researched companies that may need what you sell, with contacts and sources.
      </p>

      <h2>What we collect</h2>
      <p>We collect your name and email.</p>
      <p>If you sign in with Google, Google shares your name, email, and profile picture only.</p>
      <p>We collect the company website or domain you enter.</p>
      <p>We collect the leads and settings in your account.</p>
      <p>
        If you connect Slack, we store the connection details. We store them encrypted. We use them only to
        post leads to the channel you chose.
      </p>
      <p>We keep basic usage logs.</p>

      <h2>Companies and contacts</h2>
      <p>HotNow researches companies and business contacts from public sources and data providers.</p>

      <h2>How we use it</h2>
      <p>
        We use it to run your account, research your company, find and deliver leads, support you, and keep
        the service working.
      </p>
      <p>We do not sell personal data.</p>
      <p>We do not use Google user data for ads.</p>

      <h2>Who handles data for us</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Supabase stores the database and handles sign-in.</li>
        <li>Vercel and Render host the service.</li>
        <li>Google handles sign-in.</li>
        <li>Slack delivers leads if you connect it.</li>
        <li>Research and data providers help us find companies and contacts.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Your choices</h2>
      <p>You can disconnect Slack at any time.</p>
      <p>
        Email <a href="mailto:ankit@redstonegtm.com">ankit@redstonegtm.com</a> to ask for a copy of your data, or
        to ask us to delete your data and account.
      </p>

      <h2>Changes</h2>
      <p>When this page changes, we will update the page and the date above.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .privacy {
    max-width: 40rem;
  }

  .privacy .updated {
    margin-top: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  .privacy h2 {
    margin-top: 2.25rem;
    font-size: 1.35rem;
    line-height: 1.25;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .privacy p,
  .privacy ul {
    margin-top: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--soft);
  }

  .privacy ul {
    padding-left: 1.15rem;
    list-style: disc;
  }

  .privacy li + li {
    margin-top: 0.45rem;
  }

  .privacy a {
    color: var(--ink);
    font-weight: 500;
    text-decoration-thickness: 1px;
    text-underline-offset: 0.18em;
  }
</style>
